enders GEN-BS-005 'Inventories' (Net rollup). PG and PEP both disclose breakdowns that get collapsed today. Plan: 3 new BS canonicals (Raw Materials / Work in Process / Finished Goods) as line_items in current_assets, plus model-write conditional layout (Net renders as a `=SUM(detail)` subtotal formula when detail is present, single line_item otherwise), plus BS-1 subtotal-exclusion handling, plus model-calc forecast routing (RATIO_OF_REV per detail row, DERIVED on the Net subtotal). Estimated lift: ~3–5 hours. After inventory: resume systematic driver-kind determination (replace remaining `_label_contains` substring checks in inference.py with structural canonical metadata)."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"Sessions/CELH Model/ROADMAP.md"},"smart_blocks:Sessions/CELH Model/ROADMAP.md#Celsius HF Case Study — Roadmap": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"gsc360","at":1777476888263},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.08200435,-0.00439597,0.01995582,0.01324113,-0.03926159,0.01690459,-0.05883551,0.01202566,0.0189952,-0.01694564,0.01503615,0.01423544,0.00304104,-0.00569388,-0.02834584,-0.00597428,-0.04661985,0.04644842,0.02474596,0.02856305,0.01119938,-0.05721275,0.00037628,-0.0019893,0.01179701,0.02108418,0.00060665,-0.0128372,-0.09264402,-0.28020719,-0.01399741,-0.01475656,0.00262202,0.03113524,-0.01768,-0.02686083,-0.01309729,0.08080927,0.01194134,0.0195605,0.04894975,0.05069014,-0.0435678,-0.01757944,0.02154955,-0.02188719,-0.0583204,0.07356466,-0.07923184,-0.01715915,-0.01514697,-0.06649999,-0.00677583,0.00887654,-0.00969341,0.003521,0.05423884,-0.00421528,0.04821347,0.02032717,-0.01696292,0.0544632,-0.24381708,0.05532343,0.0052307,0.01213007,-0.05166982,-0.01814073,0.04222522,0.07597584,-0.03056157,-0.00123788,0.01082623,0.04401065,0.03875782,-0.05569439,-0.00568623,-0.0040351,0.01802839,-0.03051164,0.00937998,0.05826746,-0.04089489,0.01550593,-0.02248309,-0.05522047,0.00086553,-0.02893245,0.05526726,-0.00694592,-0.01690218,-0.